## Backend Generate Rules

### Conventions
- Use ES modules. Keep files in `src/` with folders: `models`, `routes`, `middleware`.
- Validate inputs on all write endpoints.

### Commit & PR
- Follow Conventional Commits. Reference `frontend/PRD.md` and `frontend/UI_UX.md` when adding/changing endpoints.

### Security
- Never log secrets. Sanitize logs. Enforce role checks.

